  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "What is the probability of a serendipitous encounter with a friend? Imagine you live in an area with a large general population (e.g. Stanford with 17,000 students). A small subset of the population are friends. What are the chances that you run into at least one friend if you see a handful of people from the population? Assume that seeing each person from the population is equally likely.",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
